# TF-904: Rename Parse to ParseInt and fix one expected value

## Goal

Rename the function Parse to ParseInt in the whole package, in every file and
every test that calls it. Also fix the expected value 7 in TestLoadLimit to 5.

## Dependencies

None

## Scope

Edit only the Go files of the module root. Change no other test expectation.

## Constraints

Add no dependencies. Keep behaviour the same. Commit on the task branch.

## Success criteria

### C1: No old name remains

Check: test -z "$(grep -rnw 'Parse' --include='*.go' .)"

### C2: The package builds and vets

Check: go vet ./...

### C3: The unit tests pass

Check: go test ./...

## Verification

Run each check from the repository root and report its exit code.
